# EXISTING POOL mol1_tfg_tcryo5 -- the configuration it was generated with, as a record and for re-ranking.
# gen/mol1_tfg_tcryo5 already holds poses, so 'template' and 'cofold' REFUSE (the unmixed-pool guard), and
# SCORED points at the existing merged table, so 'rerank' refuses too. Use: status | mlff | select.
# To re-run this configuration, copy it to config/arms/<new>.env with a NEW POOL and drop SET/SCORED.
POOL=mol1_tfg_tcryo5
CKPT_LABEL=mol1+tfg                       # stock weights, but a different SAMPLER: its own label
TEMPLATE_MODE=bundle
TEMPLATE_BUNDLE=$GEN_DIR/templates/cryo5.json
GUIDANCE=1                                # TFG chemistry guidance; NOT seed-comparable to mol1_tcryo5
SET=mol1tfg
SCORED=$GBSA_DIR/scored_mol1_tfg.csv
# measured: 100% pb_pass but a Fe-distance floor (2.783 A) that removes Type-II coordination --
# use it for the non-Type-II class only (SELECT_MODE=classmix)
